In order to run the tests please follow these steps:

- Unpack / copy the misc directory ( or the files in it ) to a web accessible location on your server;

- Adjust settings in "settings.cfg.php";
	- Make sure you check at least $cfg['work_dir'] to be a server writable path ( default is a direccotry called "temp" in current path );
	- Optionally adjust the number of files to be created for testing ( default is 30 000 );
	- Optionally adjust the number of time to run each test case (default is 30 );
	
- Run the tests;

- Make sure you save the log file when indicated;

- Share the log file with the community :-);  